# Deep2 Qwen32 40TPS — Batch 2/5, item 10
# Base: apply after 0006-0009.
# Goal: amortize dual-GPU row-split host transfer/wakeup overhead across
# independent matrices that share the same activation input:
#   attention Q + K + V : one two-worker wake, one input upload per GPU
#   FFN gate + up       : one two-worker wake, one input upload per GPU
#
# The GPU queues still execute each matrix in order; this patch reduces CPU,
# staging, and scheduling overhead without changing transformer math.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0010_grouped_qkv_gateup_rowsplit.patch

